+            return Refuse(who + ": golden 看不到這顆按鈕 —— grpRotate_Kit->Visible=(USE_ROTATE_KIT==1 && iRotate_Type 是 e1MotRotate／e1MotRotate1Dut／eInOutArm1Motor)"
